                                 "Créer des interfaces web modernes et responsives en utilisant les composants Blazor et le framework CSS Bootstrap."),
                new LocalizedText("# Modern Frontend Development with Blazor and Bootstrap\n\nCombining Blazor with Bootstrap creates a powerful foundation for building modern, responsive web applications. This guide shows you how to leverage both technologies effectively.\n\n## Why Blazor + Bootstrap?\n\n- **Rapid Development**: Bootstrap provides ready-to-use components\n- **Responsive Design**: Mobile-first approach built-in\n- **Consistent UI**: Standardized design patterns\n- **C# Integration**: No JavaScript required for basic interactions\n\n## Setting Up Bootstrap in Blazor\n\n```html\n<!-- In wwwroot/index.html or _Host.cshtml -->\n<link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n```\n\n## Creating Bootstrap Components\n\n### Card Component\n\n```razor\n@* BlogCard.razor *@\n<div class=\"card mb-3\">\n    <img src=\"@ImageUrl\" class=\"card-img-top\" alt=\"@Title\">\n    <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h5 class=\"card-title\">@Title</h5>\n        <p class=\"card-text\">@Description</p>\n        <a href=\"@Url\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Read More</a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n@code {\n    [Parameter] public string Title { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n    [Parameter] public string Description { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n    [Parameter] public string ImageUrl { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n    [Parameter] public string Url { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n}\n```\n\n### Navigation Component\n\n```razor\n@* NavMenu.razor *@\n<nav class=\"navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-primary\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <a class=\"navbar-brand\" href=\"/\">@AppName</a>\n        <button class=\"navbar-toggler\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#navbarNav\">\n            <span class=\"navbar-toggler-icon\"></span>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse\" id=\"navbarNav\">\n            <ul class=\"navbar-nav ms-auto\">\n                <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                    <NavLink class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/\" Match=\"NavLinkMatch.All\">Home</NavLink>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                    <NavLink class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</NavLink>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                    <NavLink class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/about\">About</NavLink>\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</nav>\n\n@code {\n    [Parameter] public string AppName { get; set; } = \"MyApp\";\n}\n```\n\n## Responsive Grid System\n\n```razor\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"col-md-8\">\n            <main>\n                <!-- Main content -->\n            </main>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n            <aside>\n                <!-- Sidebar content -->\n            </aside>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Interactive Forms\n\n```razor\n<EditForm Model=\"@model\" OnValidSubmit=\"@HandleValidSubmit\">\n    <DataAnnotationsValidator />\n    <ValidationSummary class=\"alert alert-danger\" />\n    \n    <div class=\"mb-3\">\n        <label for=\"email\" class=\"form-label\">Email</label>\n        <InputText @bind-Value=\"model.Email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"email\" />\n        <ValidationMessage For=\"@(() => model.Email)\" class=\"text-danger\" />\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"mb-3\">\n        <label for=\"message\" class=\"form-label\">Message</label>\n        <InputTextArea @bind-Value=\"model.Message\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"message\" rows=\"3\" />\n        <ValidationMessage For=\"@(() => model.Message)\" class=\"text-danger\" />\n    </div>\n    \n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Submit</button>\n</EditForm>\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use CSS Classes**: Prefer Bootstrap classes over custom CSS\n2. **Component Reusability**: Create reusable Blazor components\n3. **Responsive Design**: Test on multiple screen sizes\n4. **Accessibility**: Include proper ARIA labels and semantic HTML\n5. **Performance**: Use CSS bundling and minification\n\n## Custom Theming\n\n```css\n/* Custom Bootstrap variables */\n:root {\n    --bs-primary: #007bff;\n    --bs-secondary: #6c757d;\n    --bs-success: #28a745;\n}\n\n/* Custom component styles */\n.custom-card {\n    border: 2px solid var(--bs-primary);\n    border-radius: 0.75rem;\n}\n```\n\nBlazor and Bootstrap together provide a powerful combination for creating modern, responsive web applications with minimal effort and maximum impact.",
                                 "# Développement frontend moderne avec Blazor et Bootstrap\n\nCombiner Blazor avec Bootstrap crée une base puissante pour créer des applications web modernes et responsives. Ce guide vous montre comment exploiter efficacement ces deux technologies.\n\n## Pourquoi Blazor + Bootstrap ?\n\n- **Développement rapide** : Bootstrap fournit des composants prêts à l'emploi\n- **Design responsif** : Approche mobile-first intégrée\n- **Interface utilisateur cohérente** : Modèles de conception standardisés\n- **Intégration C#** : Pas de JavaScript requis pour les interactions de base\n\n## Configuration de Bootstrap dans Blazor\n\n```html\n<!-- Dans wwwroot/index.html ou _Host.cshtml -->\n<link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\n```\n\n## Création de composants Bootstrap\n\n### Composant Card\n\n```razor\n@* BlogCard.razor *@\n<div class=\"card mb-3\">\n    <img src=\"@ImageUrl\" class=\"card-img-top\" alt=\"@Title\">\n    <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <h5 class=\"card-title\">@Title</h5>\n        <p class=\"card-text\">@Description</p>\n        <a href=\"@Url\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Lire la suite</a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n@code {\n    [Parameter] public string Title { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n    [Parameter] public string Description { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n    [Parameter] public string ImageUrl { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n    [Parameter] public string Url { get; set; } = string.Empty;\n}\n```\n\n### Composant Navigation\n\n```razor\n@* NavMenu.razor *@\n<nav class=\"navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-primary\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <a class=\"navbar-brand\" href=\"/\">@AppName</a>\n        <button class=\"navbar-toggler\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#navbarNav\">\n            <span class=\"navbar-toggler-icon\"></span>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse\" id=\"navbarNav\">\n            <ul class=\"navbar-nav ms-auto\">\n                <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                    <NavLink class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/\" Match=\"NavLinkMatch.All\">Accueil</NavLink>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                    <NavLink class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</NavLink>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                    <NavLink class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/about\">À propos</NavLink>\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</nav>\n\n@code {\n    [Parameter] public string AppName { get; set; } = \"MonApp\";\n}\n```\n\n## Système de grille responsive\n\n```razor\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"col-md-8\">\n            <main>\n                <!-- Contenu principal -->\n            </main>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n            <aside>\n                <!-- Contenu de la barre latérale -->\n            </aside>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Formulaires interactifs\n\n```razor\n<EditForm Model=\"@model\" OnValidSubmit=\"@HandleValidSubmit\">\n    <DataAnnotationsValidator />\n    <ValidationSummary class=\"alert alert-danger\" />\n    \n    <div class=\"mb-3\">\n        <label for=\"email\" class=\"form-label\">Email</label>\n        <InputText @bind-Value=\"model.Email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"email\" />\n        <ValidationMessage For=\"@(() => model.Email)\" class=\"text-danger\" />\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"mb-3\">\n        <label for=\"message\" class=\"form-label\">Message</label>\n        <InputTextArea @bind-Value=\"model.Message\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"message\" rows=\"3\" />\n        <ValidationMessage For=\"@(() => model.Message)\" class=\"text-danger\" />\n    </div>\n    \n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Envoyer</button>\n</EditForm>\n```\n\n## Meilleures pratiques\n\n1. **Utilisez les classes CSS** : Préférez les classes Bootstrap au CSS personnalisé\n2. **Réutilisabilité des composants** : Créez des composants Blazor réutilisables\n3. **Design responsif** : Testez sur plusieurs tailles d'écran\n4. **Accessibilité** : Incluez des étiquettes ARIA appropriées et du HTML sémantique\n5. **Performance** : Utilisez le regroupement et la minification CSS\n\n## Thème personnalisé\n\n```css\n/* Variables Bootstrap personnalisées */\n:root {\n    --bs-primary: #007bff;\n    --bs-secondary: #6c757d;\n    --bs-success: #28a745;\n}\n\n/* Styles de composants personnalisés */\n.custom-card {\n    border: 2px solid var(--bs-primary);\n    border-radius: 0.75rem;\n}\n```\n\nBlazor et Bootstrap ensemble offrent une combinaison puissante pour créer des applications web modernes et responsives avec un effort minimal et un impact maximal."),
